 "summary": "The M\u00f6bius identity, the bundled direct-sum induction map, and the rational base-change criterion are genuinely new: Mathlib has no Artin induction, no Fintype-derived LocallyFiniteOrderTop for a poset without a top, and no surjectivity criterion for base-changing a non-surjective integral map. Existing API (IncidenceAlgebra.sum_Icc_mu_left, Fintype.toLocallyFiniteOrder, natCard_mul_indClassFun, indClassFunAddHom, DirectSum.toAddMonoid, LinearMap.baseChange) is reused, the superseded cyclic-specific declarations are deleted with no dangling references, and a pre-existing duplicated proof block is reduced to one occurrence.",
